    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/New_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"New Republic Campaign Guide\">New Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Regional_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Regional Feats\">Regional Feats</a></i></p><p>You were born and raised in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Outer_Rim\" title=\"The Outer Rim\">The Outer Rim</a>.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You were raised in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Outer_Rim_Territories\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Outer Rim Territories\">The Outer Rim Territories</a>, the untamed outlands of the Republic. Many of the worlds of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Outer_Rim\" title=\"The Outer Rim\">The Outer Rim</a> are primitive and have little technology. You are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ride\" title=\"Ride\">Ride</a> skills.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You may only select a single Regional Feat.</p>",
